    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds good in theory, but if you had to pick one as the actual priority for stability, which one is more foundational? Like, can you even have economic integration and social stability if the border isn't first secured and controlled? Or is the security side just a temporary fix that ignores the actual economic needs?",
