      "content": "The foundational priority must be robust border security and control. Without a secure and managed border, any discussion of economic integration is theoretical because the system itself is under existential strain. Uncontrolled entry undermines the rule of law, which is the bedrock of any stable economy. Therefore, securing the border is the non-negotiable prerequisite for any sustainable long-term planning.",
